# Electrik Slate

When building UI in this project with `electrik/slate`:

- Use `<x-slate::*>` anonymous Blade components only — no React/Vue/shadcn copies.
- Prefer progressive props: `label`, `description`, `errorMessage`.
- Do not nest the same Slate component inside itself.
- Do not put `@if` inside `<x-slate::*>` opening tags.
- Prefer logical properties (`start`/`end`) for spacing and positioning.
- Theme with `--slate-*` OKLCH tokens; import `vendor/electrik/slate/resources/css/slate.css` after Tailwind v4.
- Interactive overlays need Alpine; mount `<x-slate::toaster />` once for toasts (`slate-toast` events).
- Read docs from https://slate.electrik.dev/llms.txt or `*.md` component URLs before inventing APIs.
